.TH "mbedded\-cbor\-advanced\-path" "7" "2026-11-08" "mbedded\-cbor 0.9.0" "mbedded\-cbor"
.SH Paths in detail
This page adds the details to ../path.md.
A path in brackets and in a filter also takes a literal of CBOR
diagnostic notation, EDN (draft\-ietf\-cbor\-edn\-literals\-28), so a
key can be any CBOR item.
A path at compile time and a path at run time read the same grammar.
.PP
Every function is in the namespace \f[CR]cbor\f[R].
A comment shows the CBOR in \f[CR]bytes\f[R] as text.
In the examples, \f[CR]l\f[R] is a \f[CR]cbor::lazy\f[R] over
\f[CR]bytes\f[R].
